{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 36,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Elihu also proceeded, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Suffer me a little, and I will show thee;\nFor I have yet somewhat to say on God’s behalf.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will fetch my knowledge from afar,\nAnd will ascribe righteousness to my Maker.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For truly my words are not false:\nOne that is perfect in knowledge is with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God is mighty, and despiseth not any:\nHe is mighty in strength of understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He preserveth not the life of the wicked,\nBut giveth to the afflicted ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " right.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He withdraweth not his eyes from the righteous:\nBut with kings upon the throne\nHe setteth them for ever, and they are exalted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if they be bound in fetters,\nAnd be taken in the cords of affliction;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he showeth them their work,\nAnd their transgressions, that they have behaved themselves proudly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He openeth also their ear to instruction,\nAnd commandeth that they return from iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If they hearken and serve ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",\nThey shall spend their days in prosperity,\nAnd their years in pleasures.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if they hearken not, they shall perish by the sword,\nAnd they shall die without knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But they that are godless in heart lay up anger:\nThey cry not for help when he bindeth them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They die in youth,\nAnd their life ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "perisheth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among the unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He delivereth the afflicted by their affliction,\nAnd openeth their ear in oppression.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, he would have allured thee out of distress\nInto a broad place, where there is no straitness;\nAnd that which is set on thy table would be full of fatness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou art full of the judgment of the wicked:\nJudgment and justice take hold ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "on thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For let not wrath stir thee up against chastisements;\nNeither let the greatness of the ransom turn thee aside.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will thy cry avail, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that thou be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in distress,\nOr all the forces of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " strength?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Desire not the night,\nWhen peoples are cut off in their place.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take heed, regard not iniquity:\nFor this hast thou chosen rather than affliction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God doeth loftily in his power:\nWho is a teacher like unto him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who hath enjoined him his way?\nOr who can say, Thou hast wrought unrighteousness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember that thou magnify his work,\nWhereof men have sung.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All men have looked thereon;\nMan beholdeth it afar off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God is great, and we know him not;\nThe number of his years is unsearchable.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he draweth up the drops of water,\nWhich distil in rain from his vapor,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which the skies pour down\nAnd drop upon man abundantly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, can any understand the spreadings of the clouds,\nThe thunderings of his pavilion?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, he spreadeth his light around him;\nAnd he covereth the bottom of the sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For by these he judgeth the peoples;\nHe giveth food in abundance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He covereth his hands with the lightning,\nAnd giveth it a charge that it strike the mark.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.36.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The noise thereof telleth concerning him,\nThe cattle also concerning ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the storm",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that cometh up.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
